on.</article-title><source>Oncogene</source><volume>27</volume><fpage>6970</fpage><lpage>6980</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19029938</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006511-Piao1"><label>26</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Piao</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mori</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Satoh</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Sugita</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Tokunaga</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Inhibition of endothelial cell proliferation, in vitro angiogenesis, and the down-regulation of cell adhesion-related genes by genistein.Combined with a cDNA microarray analysis.</article-title><source>Endothelium</source><volume>13</volume><fpage>249</fpage><lpage>266</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16990182</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006511-Bazas1"><label>27</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bazas</surname><given-names>VM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lukyanova</surname><given-names>NY</given-names></name><name><surname>Demash</surname><given-names>DV</given-names></name><name><surname>Galakhin</surname><given-names>KO</given-names></name><name><surname>Myasoedov</surname><given-names>DV</given-names></name></person-group><year>2008</year><article-title>Relation between cell-to-cell adhesion and angiogenesis and clinico-morphological prognostic factors in patients with gastric cancer.</article-title><source>Exp Oncol</source><volume>30</volume><fpage>235</fpage><lpage>239</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18806748</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006511-Ramjaun1"><label>28</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ramjaun</surname><g